   "subject": "using sendmailR package with Shiny",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Below is an MRE that works fine locally, but which fails on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u_Ib8u0M_5wRW5g2GYWiU\">shinyapps.io</a> (except for the dummy gmail addresses).<div><br></div><div>Checking the logs, the mailer doesn&#39;t get a connection: &quot;SMTP 421&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>Is there a (security) reason this functionality fails on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u_Ib8u0M_5wRW5g2GYWiU\">shinyapps.io</a> and/or shinyServer?<br><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sendmailR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bootstrapPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sendSignal&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Press 3x to Send&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;my_button&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;subject&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Subject:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>output$my_button </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$sendSignal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">##Send an email after actionButton pressed a few times; use some input from UI</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$sendSignal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sendmail</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">te...@gmail.com</a>&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               to </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;test2@g</span><span style=\"color:#080\"><a href=\"http://mail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mail.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KC4cq9rsGMsJYl0ayJvp_\">mail.com</a>&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               subject </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> isolate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$subject</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>               msg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mime_part</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">##</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               control</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">smtpServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"http://ASPMX.L.GOOGLE.COM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ASPMX.L.GOOGLE.COM&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lS2H7SYd0aHRAkdYSq0s9\">ASPMX.L.GOOGLE.COM</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
