    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, May 22, 2015 at 3:21:09 AM UTC+5:30, ArjunaMeridian wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Below is an MRE that works fine locally, but which fails on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HT4bnWoRmI_hWUOvfNVNq\">shinyapps.io</a> (except for the dummy gmail addresses).<div><br></div><div>Checking the logs, the mailer doesn&#39;t get a connection: &quot;SMTP 421&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>Is there a (security) reason this functionality fails on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360923268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HT4bnWoRmI_hWUOvfNVNq\">shinyapps.io</a> and/or shinyServer?<br><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sendmailR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bootstrapPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sendSignal&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Press 3x to Send&quot;